// From _prefabs/zm/zm_giant/geo/zone_b/zoneb_glass_roof_arch_01.map, brush 0.
// CURVE primitive (Bezier-smoothed) — for comparison with mesh.
// 5x3 control points. T1=16 (subdivision count, higher = smoother).
//
// curve vs mesh:
//   curve = Bezier interpolation between control points; the engine
//           subdivides each span by T1 (here 16) for smooth visual
//   mesh  = flat triangulation; control points connect linearly
//
// For terrain heightmaps, BOTH work but mesh is simpler and faster.
// mp_sector rock terrain uses mesh. Decorative arches use curve.
// brush 0
